  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improving CPT Maraba&apos;s security</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of the project is to increase security systems and measures in CPT&apos;s office and protection of staff after a series of death threats that were made against CPT staff during the last few months of 2015. This will be achieved through the following outputs:
&#x2022;	improved office security access - installation of an electric gate and improvement of the CCTV system;
&#x2022;	improved home security of one member of CPT&apos;s staff - installation of alarm and sensor and CCTV systems, increased  height of the external walls.</narrative>
  </description>
